  type_pointer_err_qualified_star.pcpp - break step of type_pointer.pcpp:
  a qualified name takes no C++ '*': write ptr to M.T (PR0028)

  How to check, from repo\bin:
    pcpp res\tests\type_pointer_err_qualified_star.pcpp
    pcpp res\tests\type_pointer_err_qualified_star.pcpp -t x86_64-linux-gnu
  The marked line reports that code; nothing else is reported.
